# w4_entry_points.lj4s - W4 acceptance 2 (design 10 W4): every window of feature-inventory section 2 opened from its
# documented entry point (menu path, toolbar button, form button, popup item or hotkey), never by `open <id>` unless
# the row says so (automatic windows). One `log "PASS ..."` line and one shot per window. W4 integrator 2, 2026-10-22.
# Run from the repo root in a scratch library prepared by tests/ui/scripts/w4_entry_prep.sh (Main.Ini [DEBUG]
# DebugWindow=1 so View > De&bugWindow shows; Fingers.Ini [SETUP] Mode=1 so Virtual Fingers opens without its prompt):
#   build-w4\lj4evr.exe U:W4Entry --script tests\ui\scripts\w4_entry_points.lj4s 2> entry.log
# Evidence: docs/w4-integration.md "Acceptance", item 2. Shots: docs/screenshots/w4/entry/.

# ---- setup: MAC 500 Mode 2/4 at 1:001, Generic DMX Dimmer at 1:017 (the W1 walkthrough's patch) ----
assert_caption main "LJ4EVR (User lib: W4Entry)"
log "PASS Main desktop (TLJMainForm) <- startup"
assert_caption please_wait "Startup Status"
log "PASS Startup Status (TStartupStatusWindow) <- startup (selfdestruct in 10 s)"
shot docs/screenshots/w4/entry/main.png
click main.Config21                               # Setup > Fixture Configuration
assert_caption fixture_config "Fixture Configuration"
log "PASS Fixture Configuration (TLinkConfigForm3) <- Setup > Fixture Configuration"
click TLinkConfigForm3.tvAvailable 100 8
click TLinkConfigForm3.sbMartin
key Right
key Down 60
key Right
key Right
click TLinkConfigForm3.bAdd                       # Add Fixture (s)
assert_caption add_fixtures "Add Fixture (s)"
log "PASS Add Fixture(s) (TAddFixForm2) <- Fixture Configuration > Add Fixture (s)"
shot docs/screenshots/w4/entry/add-fixtures.png
click TAddFixForm2.bOk
click TLinkConfigForm3.eAdr
type "1"
key Enter
click TLinkConfigForm3.tvAvailable 100 8
click TLinkConfigForm3.sbGeneric
key Right
key Right
key Right
click TLinkConfigForm3.bAdd
click TAddFixForm2.bOk
click TLinkConfigForm3.eAdr
type "17"
key Enter
assert_text TLinkConfigForm3.LFixtures "7 Fixtures configured"       # fixtures 3-7 from w4_entry_prep.sh
shot docs/screenshots/w4/entry/fixture-config.png
click TLinkConfigForm3.bSave
assert_prompt "Clear data for new fixtures ?"
log "PASS Prompt Please Confirm.. (TConfirmForm) <- Fixture Configuration > Save"
click confirm.BOk
close fixture_config
wait 300
close cue_form
close seq_form
assert_caption TUnassignedForm "Unassigned Fixtures"
log "PASS Unassigned Fixtures (TUnassignedForm) <- automatic after Fixture Configuration"
shot docs/screenshots/w4/entry/unassigned.png
drag TUnassignedForm.LV_Unassigned main.desktop 40 26 -300 -120
wait 300
click TUnassignedForm.BitBtn1                     # Auto Place All
assert_prompt "Place all Fixtures on this tab ?"
log "PASS Prompt Place all Fixtures on this tab ? <- Unassigned Fixtures > Auto Place All"
click confirm.BOk
wait 300
assert_text main.icon1 "(1) MAC500"
assert_text main.icon2 "(2) DMX1"
# ---- inventory section 2, top to bottom ----
close seq_form
close cue_form
